    "description": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is a splendid hybrid sauna for those looking to improve their health. As a hybrid sauna, it features two types of heaters: traditional electric Harvia heaters and full-spectrum infra-red heaters. Enjoying this sauna with someone comfortably promotes bonding as well as well-being through increasing body temperature to induce sweating.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sweating sessions in the sauna lead to a healthier life. Sweating in a cozy surrounding with a smile on your face is something to look forward too. There are good reasons why so many people use saunas regularly and it&rsquo;s not just the health benefits, it&rsquo;s also the feel-good factor.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Diamond line saunas offer more views of the outside from inside the sauna and vice versa. Plenty of light comes through well-placed windows.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A person-oriented design of the interior makes this sauna very comfortable to be in. It looks great from the outside.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It is a great addition to any home.</span></p>",
